Question content formatting

Questions and answers now support DokuWiki-rendered content, including:
- image links (e.g. {{:wiki:image.png}})
- normal links and internal links
- LaTeX/math syntax provided by your math plugin
- custom plugin tags such as <tikzjax>...</tikzjax>

Within each question block, place all question lines first, then answers.
- Normal answer line: starts with "- "
- Correct answer line: starts with "*" (with or without "- " before it)

Example:

<flashcards>
<questions>
What is shown in this image?
{{:wiki:diagram.png}}
- Option A
* Option B
- $\\frac{1}{2}$
- {{:wiki:option-image.png}}
---
</questions>
</flashcards>